{"Blacklisted guest emails can be bypassed by changing letter casing because the blacklist is lowercased but incoming guest emails are not normalized before comparison": 0.9864609241485596, "The isTeamAdminOrOwner variable uses && (AND) instead of || (OR), requiring a user to pass both isTeamAdmin and isTeamOwner checks, incorrectly denying team admins access to add guests": 0.9602325558662415, "sendAddGuestsEmails is invoked with the raw input guest list instead of uniqueGuests, so attendees who were not actually added (already-attendees/blacklisted/duplicates) may receive incorrect emails": 0.9956468939781189, "Backend does not deduplicate the input guests array before createMany, allowing direct API calls to create multiple attendee rows with the same email on the same booking": 0.9800788760185242, "sendAddGuestsEmails always sends organizer and attendee emails without applying eventTypeDisableHostEmail/eventTypeDisableAttendeeEmail guards, ignoring user notification disable settings": 0.9954096674919128}